<title>USA: Immune Response offers 2.2 mln shrs $6.50.</title>
<headline>Immune Response offers 2.2 mln shrs $6.50.</headline>
<dateline>CARLSBAD, Calif. 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Immune Response Corp's 2.2 million share public offering of common stock was priced at $6.50 per share, the company said.</p>
<p>Bayer AG unit Bayer Corp has indicated it will purchase 615,400 shares.  All of the shares are being sold by the company.  Immune Response, a biopharmaceutical company, has granted the underwriters an option to purchase an additional 330,000 shares to cover over-allotments.</p>
<p>The offering is being managed by Hanifen, Imhoff Inc and Cruttenden Roth Inc.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
